#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-tag-e.rst:5
#: 455eb273d64f4e4a94fef36ff4bb91b5
msgid "AirPixel TAG-E for Camera Control and EXIF Geotagging of ILX-LR1"
msgstr "AirPixel TAG-E 用于 ILX-LR1 的相机控制与 EXIF 地理标记"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-tag-e.rst:11
#: f9119a3515ac41d0bf5cd34a86d70073
msgid ""
"The `TAG-E <https://airpixel.cz/tag-e/>`_ is new camera controller and "
"geotagger for Sony ILX-LR1 camera. TAG-E uses MAVLink Camera Control "
"protocol v2 to interface camera features to the user. QGC will automatically"
" show exposure controls, triggering, timelapse and and configuration "
"features in any Android device or PC/MAC. For MissionPlanner there is an "
"plugin for camera and geotagging control. TAG-E is using single USB-C "
"connection to the camera, no WiFi, no additional modules. Geotagging is "
"instant, without necessity of geoagging initiation. Triggering is available "
"at full speed, no slow-down due to geotagging processing. TAG-E also "
"automatically configure camera internal clock by GPS time received from the "
"MAVLink, so images will have correct creation date every time."
msgstr ""
"`TAG-E <https://airpixel.cz/tag-e/>`_ 是专为 Sony ILX-LR1 "
"相机设计的新型相机控制器和地理标记设备。TAG-E 使用 MAVLink 相机控制协议 v2 将相机功能接口给用户。QGC 将在任何 Android "
"设备或 PC/MAC 上自动显示曝光控制、触发、延时摄影和配置功能。对于 Mission Planner，有专用的相机和地理标记控制插件。TAG-E "
"仅通过单根 USB-C 连接相机，无需 "
"WiFi，无需额外模块。地理标记即时完成，无需发起地理标记初始化。触发可在全速下进行，不因地理标记处理而减速。TAG-E 还会通过从 MAVLink "
"接收的 GPS 时间自动配置相机内部时钟，使图像每次都有正确的创建日期。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-tag-e.rst:17
#: 3fca657562b248aba22cb3fe9ab1908b
msgid "Compatible only with Sony ILX-LR1"
msgstr "仅兼容 Sony ILX-LR1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-tag-e.rst:18
#: 2ed87d825fb449efb6a7998baa59cbc3
msgid ""
"Photos are automatically geotagged (via EXIF) with the Lat, Lon, Altitude "
"and camera angles (read from the gimbal)"
msgstr "照片自动通过 EXIF 标记纬度、经度、高度和相机角度（从云台读取）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-tag-e.rst:19
#: 428c2c98736246e082d370a540249bc7
msgid ""
"Optionally can geotags be expanded for GPS time, Rangefinder measurement, "
"GPS/IMU accuracy, Focal plane distance and resolution or Custom user label"
msgstr "可选将地理标记扩展为 GPS 时间、测距仪测量、GPS/IMU 精度、焦平面距离和分辨率或自定义用户标签"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-tag-e.rst:20
#: 57d6ae02513548d4b8f4d1bd7004495e
msgid "HereLink camera control via QGC UI"
msgstr "通过 QGC 界面在 HereLink 上控制相机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-tag-e.rst:21
#: 0917a059156c46aca40131b36e1e1004
msgid "HereLink camera control via MavCam (optional)"
msgstr "通过 MavCam 在 HereLink 上控制相机（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-tag-e.rst:22
#: 91abf27b6da447df94acfff022d9db2f
msgid "Mission Planner implementation via plugin"
msgstr "通过插件在 Mission Planner 中实现"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-tag-e.rst:23
#: b75f2d2101ef4ad486156a70825b1bc4
msgid "Precise lever arm calculations based on Antenna to Camera offsets"
msgstr "基于天线到相机偏移量的精确杠杆臂计算"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-tag-e.rst:24
#: fef1dd043f094d2ca9abaec2c419507a
msgid "GeoTagging is available at the *maximum speed of the camera*"
msgstr "地理标记可在*相机最高速度*下进行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-tag-e.rst:25
#: 05ef6a3a1d624b30933d4a5ab2a7abb6
msgid "Automatic camera clock configuration by GPS time"
msgstr "通过 GPS 时间自动配置相机时钟"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-tag-e.rst:26
#: d42a28f6fd384db4af47640729cff9a6
msgid "Enhanced file/folder grouping per flight for better user exprience"
msgstr "按飞行分组增强文件/文件夹管理，提升用户体验"

